# The lobby photograph. This repo is PUBLIC, and static/ is committed — so a
# picture of the two of them would be on GitHub permanently, history and all.
# The Dockerfile copies static/ wholesale at build time, so an ignored file
# still ships to Fly: the deployed game has it and the public repo does not.
# The lobby hides the frame if it is missing, so a fresh clone still works.
